# depends on:
#  escape sequence std.io.print from stdpbl versio 1 or greater

# helpers
Func print
New __Escape_std.io.print_ARG0 <msg>
Escape std.io.print
End

# bytecode 2
New 0 "1 + 01"
New msg 0
Call print 

New 1 "18 + 0003"
New msg 1
Call print 

New 2 '3'
New 3 "2 s++ 08"
New msg 3
Call print 

